    "notes": "<p>Device access levels:</p><p></p><p>Infiltrate actions:</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Enable or Disable</p></td><td><p>Turn the device on or off</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Set volume</p></td><td><p>Change the level of noise generated by the beacon</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Set illumination</p></td><td><p>Change the level of light emitted by the beacon</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Access logs</p></td><td><p>Access how this device was used recently</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>Control actions:</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Reprogram sound</p></td><td><p>Cause the beacon to emit a new repetative sound at any volume level. The sound illusion can be perceived with a difficulty check equal to the Difficulty of the device</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Detonate</p></td><td><p>d4 damage to all creatures within Very Close. Make a Reaction check against this device's Difficulty to take half damage.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Send message</p></td><td><p>Cause the beason to emit a message to all subscribed devices and personnel</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
